<title>USA: Coded Communications Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Coded Communications Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(UNAUDITED)</p>
<p>		 (Amounts in thousands except per share)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			   Sep 28,   Sep 30,	Sep 28,    Sep 30</p>
<p>				1996	1995	   1996	1995</p>
<p>Operating Data:</p>
<p> Net sales		$3,405    $2,589	 $8,675    $7,115</p>
<p> Gross margin	    1,472     1,230	  3,796     1,915</p>
<p> Operating expenses    1,258     1,207	  3,342     3,830</p>
<p>Income (loss) before</p>
<p>   interest and taxes    214	  23	    454   (1,915)</p>
<p>Income (loss) before</p>
<p>   extraordinary gain    189     (172)	     11   (2,503)</p>
<p> Extraordinary gain (A)  643     1,256	    858     1,256</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	 832     1,084	    869   (1,247)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per</p>
<p>   share		     .01	 .07	    .02     (.08)</p>
<p>Average shares</p>
<p>   outstanding (B)    74,761    15,146	 34,728    13,605</p>
<p>(A) Results for the three and nine month periods ended September 28, 1996 and September 30, 1995, include extraordinary gains from the extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>(B) In September 1996 the Company completed the investment transaction with Grupo ISA and the restructuring of secured debt. As a result of these transactions, issued and outstanding shares at September 28, 1996 increased by 57,615,000 shares to approximately 72,445,000 common shares.</p>
